{{!-- A2, "split hero": the statement beside the page's photograph, ruled off below.

	{{> "about/hero-split" eyebrow=(t "About")}}     called from inside {{#post}}

	eyebrow   the theme's word for what kind of Surface this is

The photograph is the page's own feature image, which is the only picture a Ghost page carries
and exactly what the editor's title-and-feature-image toggle turns off — so the toggle owns this
hero whole, the same as the centred one.

`auto-fit` rather than two fixed tracks: a page with no feature image collapses to a single
column of statement instead of leaving half the row empty, and below 320px per track the two
stack on their own without a breakpoint.

NOT `loading="lazy"`. This is the Surface's largest image and the first thing on the page — its
LCP element — so deferring it would defer the paint the page is measured by. `decoding="async"`
stays because the design source carries it, and the reference build's own capture, which is this
Surface's Floor, was taken with it. --}}
{{#if @page.show_title_and_feature_image}}
	<section
		aria-labelledby="a2-h"
		class="border-border border-b">
		<div class="container py-20">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(320px,100%),1fr))] items-center gap-14">
				<div>
					<p class="font-meta text-meta text-accent tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">{{eyebrow}}</p>

					<h1
						id="a2-h"
						class="font-display tracking-display mt-6 max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(36px,4.8vw,58px)] leading-[1.04] font-medium text-balance">{{title}}</h1>

					{{!-- `custom_excerpt`, not `{{excerpt}}`, because this Surface prints `{{content}}`
					below and Ghost's excerpt falls back to the opening of that body — see
					centered-intro.hbs for the measurement. --}}
					{{#if custom_excerpt}}
						<p class="text-lead text-muted mt-[22px] max-w-[46ch] leading-[1.55] text-pretty">{{custom_excerpt}}</p>
					{{/if}}
				</div>

				{{#if feature_image}}
					<img
						src="{{img_url feature_image size="xl"}}"
						{{> "image-srcset" image=feature_image sizes="(min-width: 768px) 600px, 100vw"}}
						{{#if feature_image_alt}}alt="{{feature_image_alt}}"{{else}}alt=""{{/if}}
						decoding="async"
						class="border-border block aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-md border object-cover">
				{{/if}}
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
{{/if}}
